---
description: Flutter mobile rules for apps/mobile/ — GetX only
globs: apps/mobile/**
---

Full rules in `docs/rules/mobile.md`. Key points:

- **GetX only** — no BLoC, flutter_bloc, GetIt, go_router, Equatable
- State: `GetxController` + `.obs`; UI: `Obx(() => ...)` or `GetView<Controller>`
- DI: `Get.lazyPut<T>(() => ..., fenix: true)` in `Bindings`; `Get.find<T>()` to resolve
- Routing: `GetMaterialApp`, `GetPage`, `Get.toNamed` / `Get.offAllNamed`
- Networking: keep Dio + Retrofit; wrap in `safeApiCall`
- Auth: JWT in `flutter_secure_storage`; `SessionService` drives navigation
- Tokens: `AppColors`, `AppSpacing`, `AppRadius`, `AppTextStyles` — never inline values
- Design fidelity: read Figma Owezy Mobile (`aPUmKuvCpwnIAD5m53Rh7c`) via MCP (`get_screenshot` + `get_design_context`) before UI; no inventing Material chrome when frames exist — not local `resources/owezy-mobile/`
- **Localization required:** Flutter gen-l10n (`lib/l10n/*.arb` + `AppLocalizations`); no hardcoded UI copy; no GetX `.tr`
- Feature structure: `data/ → domain/ → presentation/`; binding per feature page
